url: https://ichicomi.com/series/yurihime
why: 'The first three series blocks of 一迅プラス''s yuri listing, kept whole because the
  counter-case is INSIDE a block and not between them. Each block writes data-series-name
  three times: once on the anchor around the thumbnail, then again on the 1話へ and
  最新話へ buttons, which come after it. A reader that scans the page instead of the block
  pairs those trailing copies with the NEXT block''s thumbnail, which is how 163 of
  164 works took their neighbour''s series id and the listing''s second entry dropped
  out of the run altogether. Cutting the buttons would leave a fixture the broken
  reader passes. Three blocks rather than two, because two cannot show that the shift
  keeps going.'
---
